Remove google_tag and osu_google_tag from the osu_standard profile
dependencies so they can be uninstalled per-site (profile dependencies
are locked against uninstall). Neither module does anything without a
GTM container, and the platform's default osu_global container was
deleted by osu_google_tag's own update hook. The shipped role configs
must drop their google_tag dependency and permission too, or a fresh
site:install fails on unmet dependencies.

diff --git a/osu_standard.info.yml b/osu_standard.info.yml
--- a/osu_standard.info.yml
+++ b/osu_standard.info.yml
@@ -95,7 +95,6 @@
   - fontawesome
   - google_analytics
   - google_cse
-  - google_tag
   - honeypot
   - image_effects
   - imagemagick
@@ -159,7 +158,6 @@
   # Custom Modules
   - osu_bootstrap_layout_builder
   - osu_ckeditor_plugins
-  - osu_google_tag
   - osu_simple_popup_blocks
   - osu_default_content
   - osu_media
